# Learning Transport message/queue files
# This directory is bind-mounted into the ServiceControl, Audit, Monitoring,
# and SmokeTest containers so you can inspect message files on the host for
# debugging. Ignore its contents (including the .learningtransport data
# folder created by NServiceBus) but keep this directory tracked.
*
!.gitignore
.DS_Store
.learningtransport/
